@startuml
title RAG Index Update Automation (Cron + ChromaDB)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 220

actor "Ops/Dev" as ops

folder "Host filesystem" as host {
  file "Knowledge Base\nknowledge_base/*.txt\n(../task2/knowledge_base/)" as kb
  file "Terms Map\nterms_map.json" as terms_map
  file "File State\nfile_state.json\n(hashes & mtimes)" as state_file
  folder "Logs\nupdate_log.txt" as log_file
  folder "Chroma persistent volume\n./chroma_db/" as chroma_data
}

node "Host System" as host_system {
  component "cron (scheduler)\n(system crontab)" as cron
  component "update_index.py\n(Indexer Script)" as script

  component "Morphological Analyzer\npymorphy2" as morph
  component "Term Replacer\n(replace_terms.py)" as replacer
  component "Chunker\n(RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter)" as chunker
  component "Embedding Model\nBAAI/bge-m3\n(SentenceTransformer)" as embedder
  database "ChromaDB\n(PersistentClient)\n./chroma_db" as chroma
}

' --- Scheduling / Trigger
ops --> cron : configure cron job\n(crontab -e)\n0 6 * * * python update_index.py
cron --> script : runs on schedule\n(e.g., daily at 6:00)

' --- Data flow
kb --> script : scan directory\n(check file hashes)
terms_map --> script : load term replacements
script --> morph : morphological analysis\n(build word forms)
morph --> script : forms_map
script --> replacer : apply term replacements\nto document text
replacer --> script : cleaned text
script --> chunker : split text into chunks\n(chunk_size=1000, overlap=200)
chunker --> script : text chunks[]
script --> embedder : encode(chunks)\n(normalize_embeddings=True)
embedder --> script : embeddings[]
script --> chroma : upsert:\ndelete old chunks + add new\n(ids, documents, embeddings, metadatas)

' --- Persistence
chroma ..> chroma_data : persisted DB/index files
script --> state_file : save file hashes & mtimes\n(update state after processing)
script --> log_file : detailed logs\n(success/error messages)

' --- Output
script --> ops : console output\n(summary message)

' --- Notes
note right of script
- Detect changes by MD5 hash of file content
- IDs: {filename}_chunk_{index}
- Upsert = delete old chunks for changed files + add new
- Exit code: 0 (success), 1 (error)
end note

note left of cron
Task execution:
- Cron runs script directly on host
- Schedule: configurable (e.g., daily)
- On error: logs to update_log.txt + email (if configured)
end note

note bottom of embedder
Embedding Model: BAAI/bge-m3
- Multilingual support
- High performance
- Normalized embeddings
end note

@enduml
